cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these result records, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "Self-Supervised Pre-Training Drives Cross-Hospital Generalization in Histopathology (code and result records)"
abstract: >-
  Four-arm factorial (supervised baseline, self-supervised pre-training,
  sharpness-aware minimization, and both) evaluated on Camelyon17-WILDS with each
  of the five hospitals held out in turn, plus a colorectal-cancer replication on
  NCT-CRC-HE. Contains the pipeline, the aggregated result tables, the fold
  protocol and a checker that re-derives every published table.
